{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23596","headline":"仲夏斋居偶题八韵寄微之及崔湖州 · 白居易","name":"仲夏斋居偶题八韵寄微之及崔湖州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腥血与荤蔬，停来一月余。\n肌肤虽瘦损，方寸任清虚。\n体适通宵坐，头慵隔日梳。\n眼前无俗物，身外即僧居。\n水榭风来远，松廊雨过初。\n褰帘放巢燕，投食施池鱼。\n久别闲游伴，频劳问疾书。\n不知湖与越，吏隐兴何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}